 if len(sys.argv) > 1 and sys.argv[1] == \"--point\":\n        pt = [float(x) for x in sys.argv[2:5]]\n        print(json.dumps(adjudicate(pt), ensure_ascii=False))\n        return 0\n    if len(sys.argv) > 1 and sys.argv[1] == \"--formula\":\n        formula = sys.argv[2]\n        sys.path.insert(0, str(REPO / \".claude\" / \"skills\" / \"virtual-battery-factory\" / \"scripts\"))\n        from bda.simulators.comp_runner import run_composition_screen\n\n        out = run_composition_screen({\"candidates\": [{\"name\": \"candidate\", \"formula\": formula}]})\n        c = out[\"candidates\"][0]\n        if c.get(\"avg_voltage_v\") is None:\n            print(json.dumps({\"error\": c.get(\"error\", \"no voltage\")}, ensure_ascii=False))\n            return 1\n        pt = [c[\"avg_voltage_v\"], c.get(\"capacity_mah_g\", 0), c.get(\"rel_stability_ev_atom\", 0)]\n        res = adjudicate(pt, formula)\n        res[\"computed\"] = c\n        print(json.dumps(res, ensure_ascii=False))\n        return 0\n    print(\"usage: --formula <f> | --point V C stab\")\n    return 2\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n```\n\nKey adjudication semantics (verbatim from code): hull built via `scipy.spatial.Delaunay` on `[V, C, stab]` of the 84 pre-registered known-cathode points; `in_envelope` = `tri.find_simplex(pt) >= 0`; verdict = `\"REJECT (known-set analogue)\"` if INSIDE the hull, `\"PASS (outside envelope)\"` if OUTSIDE. `--point` takes exactly 3 floats (V C stab).\n\n## Task 3 — envelope_stats_comp.json\n\nPath: `D:\\research\\degradation_prognostics\\Battery_Design_Agent\\runs\\exp\\known_set_comp\\envelope_stats_comp.json`. Read fully (608 lines).\n\nALL top-level keys (in order): `points`, `excluded`, `dims`, `n`.\n\n- `points`: array of 84 objects, each `{\"name\", \"formula\", \"V\", \"C\", \"stab\"}` — V = avg voltage (V), C = capacity (mAh/g), stab = relative stability (eV/atom). First entry: `{\"name\": \"LCO\", \"formula\": \"LiCoO2\", \"V\": 3.3607373237609863, \"C\": 191.6875712243198, \"stab\": -1.580861409505208}`. Last point: `{\"name\": \"OliMnCoNi\", \"formula\": \"LiMn0.5Co0.3Ni0.2PO4\", \"V\": 4.832612832387288, \"C\": 118.14253137734114, \"stab\": -2.2967549641927087}`. Includes layered (~86), olivine/fluorophosphate-family phosphates (~36 entries with C≈116-120), LiCrO2, Li-rich Li2MnO3, spinel-free list.\n\nTAIL of file, verbatim (after the closing `]` of `points`):\n\n```json\n  \"excluded\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"LiNiPO4\",\n      \"reason\": \"calibration outlier 7.016 V (CHGNet Ni-olivine high-voltage overestimate; literature ~5.1 V)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"OliNiCoFe\",\n      \"reason\": \"calibration outlier 6.067 V (same Ni-olivine overestimate family; Ni>=0.4 phosphate computed high)\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"dims\": [\n    \"avg_voltage_v\",\n    \"capacity_mah_g\",\n    \"rel_stability_ev_atom\"\n  ],\n  \"n\": 84\n```\n\nNotable raw data point: several non-excluded Ni-containing phosphates retain suspiciously high V (e.g. `LiNiCo55` LiNi0.5Co0.5PO4 V=5.113659381866455, `LiNiMn46` V=4.7958137194315595, `OliCoMnNi` V=4.892295042673747, `OliMnCoNi` V=4.832612832387288) — only the two worst were excluded.\n\n## Task 4 — bda package / run-comp module\n\nPackage root: `D:\\research\\degradation_prognostics\\Battery_Design_Agent\\.claude\\skills\\virtual-battery-factory\\scripts\\bda\\`. Python files (Glob `**/*.py`): `__init__.py`, `__main__.py`, `cli.py`, `audit.py`, `verify_deliverables.py`, `report.py`, `store.py`, `energy.py`, `simulators/__init__.py`, `simulators/comp_runner.py`, `simulators/pybamm_runner.py`, `simulators/xtb_runner.py`, `simulators/orca_runner.py`, `simulators/mlp_runner.py`, `simulators/cp2k_runner.py`, `simulators/qe_runner.py`, `simulators/md_runner.py`, `simulators/thermal_runaway.py`, `simulators/lnmo_parameters.py`, `simulators/data/__init__.py`, `simulators/data/opls/__init__.py`.\n\n`run-comp` is implemented in `cli.py` (`_cmd_run_comp`) calling `bda.simulators.comp_runner.run_composition_screen` (file: `...\\bda\\simulators\\comp_runner.py`, 286 lines, read fully).\n\n### (a) Structure/prototype construction from a formula\n\nFile `simulators/comp_runner.py`, module docstring (lines 1-9, verbatim):\n\n```python\n\"\"\"电极组分候选筛选（run-comp）：NMC811 层状原型 + 位点替换 → CHGNet 弛豫（满锂/去锂两态）\n→ 相对稳定性 + 平均电压 + 容量代理。\n\n口径（如实声明）：\n- 结构：NMC811 层状 R-3m 原型（六方 a≈2.87 Å, c≈14.19 Å；Li 3b / TM 3a / O 6c z≈0.241），\n  4×4×1 超胞（64 原子、16 个 TM 位点）；掺杂组分按最大余数法取整，实际实现组分写入输出。\n- 能量/电压：CHGNet 代理（筛选口径，误差 0.1-0.3 V 量级）；周期 DFT 真背书缺工具（如实标注）。\n- 去锂态：x_Li=0.3 随机去锂（种子由 formula 哈希决定，可复现）。\n\"\"\"\n```\n\nNote: docstring says 4×4×1 supercell / 64 atoms / 16 TM sites, but the code actually uses `_SUPERCELL = (2, 2, 1)` and `_base_structure()` docstring says 48 atoms / 12 TM sites (`_SUPERCELL = (2, 2, 1)` at line 18). Constants (lines 17-22, verbatim):\n\n```python\n_A, _C, _O_Z = 2.87, 14.19, 0.241  # NMC811 层状 R-3m 文献晶格参数\n_SUPERCELL = (2, 2, 1)\n_X_FULL, _X_DELITH = 1.0, 0.3  # 满锂 / 去锂态的 Li 占位\n_F = 26801.481  # 法拉第常数折算：F/3.6 (mAh·mol⁻¹)\n\nNMC_BASE_FORMULA = \"Li(Ni0.8Mn0.1Co0.1)O2\"\n```\n\nDispatch (docstring of `build_doped_structure`, lines 71-75, verbatim):\n\n```python\n    原型分派（T9-new 跨家族扩展）：\n    - 含 P（含或不含 F）→ 橄榄石 Pnma（LFP 标准坐标；含 F 的氟盐类同近似，如实标注）\n    - TM 计数总和 = 2（M2O4 型）→ 尖晶石 Fd-3m（LMO 标准坐标）\n    - 其余（默认）→ 层状 R-3m（原有路径，完全不变）\n```\n\nSo: P-containing (with or without F, e.g. Li2NiPO4F) → olivine Pnma; TM fraction sum = 2 (M2O4-type, e.g. LiMn2O4) → spinel Fd-3m; everything else — including any non-layered, non-olivine, non-spinel composition (e.g. Li2MnO3, Li2MoO3, rock-salt) — falls through to the DEFAULT layered R-3m NMC811 prototype path, which is unchanged from the original code. There is NO rejection of non-layered compositions in the dispatch; however `_tm_fractions` (layered path only) raises `ValueError(\"no transition-metal species in formula: ...\")` if no non-Li/O species, and `ValueError(\"TM fractions must sum to 1; got ...\")` if TM fractions don't sum to 1.0 within 1e-6. Olivine/spinel paths normalize TM fractions instead.\n\nOlivine builder (`_build_olivine`, lines 100-103 docstring verbatim):\n\n```python\ndef _build_olivine(formula: str) -> tuple[Structure, dict[str, int], list[int]]:\n    \"\"\"橄榄石 Pnma（LiFePO4 标准参数：a=10.332 b=6.010 c=4.694 Å）。\n    代表坐标（Wyckoff）：Li 4a (0,0,0)；M 4c (0.218,0.25,0.202)；\n    P 4c (0.0946,0.25,0.0619)；O 4c×2 + 8d → 28 原子原始胞（from_spacegroup 生成）。\"\"\"\n```\n\nOlivine excludes Li, O, P, Si, F from TM set (line 116-117): `if str(k) not in (\"Li\", \"O\", \"P\", \"Si\", \"F\")`, then normalizes to M-site = 1.0. Spinel (`_build_spinel`) docstring: \"尖晶石 Fd-3m（LiMn2O4：a=8.247 Å；Li 8a、M 16d、O 32e x=0.263 → 56 原子原始胞）\", excludes only Li, O, normalizes. Both use `_largest_remainder` (largest-remainder rounding to integer counts) with `np.random.default_rng(_seed(formula))` where `_seed(formula)` = first 8 hex digits of SHA-256 of the formula.\n\n### (b) Metric formulas\n\nVoltage (lines 202-206, verbatim):\n\n```python\ndef average_voltage(e_full: float, e_delith: float, n_removed: int, e_li: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"平均电压（vs Li 金属）：V = −[E(Li_x2) − E(Li_x1) − n_removed·E_Li] / n_removed。\"\"\"\n    if n_removed <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n_removed must be positive\")\n    return -(e_full - e_delith - n_removed * e_li) / n_removed\n```\n\nPer-candidate computation in `screen_candidate` (lines 215-240, verbatim):\n\n```python\n    struct_full, counts, _ = build_doped_structure(formula)\n    seed = _seed(formula)\n    e_full, conv_full = relax_energy(struct_full)\n    n_li_full = sum(1 for s in struct_full if s.specie.symbol == \"Li\")\n    struct_delith, n_li_delith = delithiate(struct_full, _X_DELITH, seed)\n    e_delith, conv_delith = relax_energy(struct_delith)\n    n_removed = n_li_full - n_li_delith\n    avg_voltage = average_voltage(e_full, e_delith, n_removed, e_li)\n    mw = Composition(formula).weight  # g/mol\n    capacity_mah_g = (_X_FULL - _X_DELITH) * _F / mw\n    n_atoms = len(struct_full)\n    out = {\n        \"formula\": formula,\n        \"realized_tm_counts\": counts,\n        \"avg_voltage_v\": float(avg_voltage),\n        \"capacity_mah_g\": float(capacity_mah_g),\n        \"e_full_ev\": e_full,\n        \"e_delith_ev\": e_delith,\n        \"converged\": bool(conv_full and conv_delith),\n        \"rel_stability_ev_atom\": (\n            float((e_full / n_atoms) - (base_energy_fu / 4.0))\n            if base_energy_fu is not None\n            else None\n        ),\n    }\n    return out\n```\n\n- Capacity = `(1.0 − 0.3) * 26801.481 / molecular_weight` (mAh/g), i.e. the x∈[0.3,1] window only.\n- Relative stability = `E_full/n_atoms − base_energy_fu/4.0` (eV/atom), where `base_energy_fu` is the per-formula-unit relaxed energy of the NMC811 baseline (E_base/12; divided by 4 = per-atom for LiMO2). NOTE: this assumes a 4-atom formula unit for ALL candidates — including olivines/spinels (so spinel/olivine \"stab\" values are relative to a layered LiMO2 4-atom per-f.u. reference).\n- CHGNet relaxation: `StructOptimizer(model=CHGNet.load(), optimizer_class=FIRE)`, `relax(..., fmax=0.1, steps=300, relax_cell=True)`, converged if final fmax ≤ 0.1. Delithiation: random removal to x_Li=0.3, seeded.\n- Li metal reference: `_li_metal_energy()` — 2-atom bcc Li (a=3.51 Å) relaxed, per-atom energy.\n- Batch wrapper `run_composition_screen` (lines 252-253 docstring verbatim): `\"\"\"IN: {\"candidates\": [{\"formula\": \"...\", \"name\": \"...\"}]} → OUT: 每候选 metrics + 基线。\"\"\"` — also computes baseline NMC811 + bcc Li per run; per-candidate `ValueError` → `{\"name\", \"formula\", \"error\"}` entry. Output top-level keys: `baseline` (formula, e_full_ev, e_li_metal_ev, converged), `candidates`, and `calibration_note` (verbatim, lines 281-284):\n\n```python\n        \"calibration_note\": (\n            \"NMC811 基线自校准：文献平均电压 ≈3.8 V、理论容量 ≈194 mAh/g（x∈[0.3,1] 窗口）\"\n            \"——若基线预测显著偏离，说明本批结果不可信（如实标注）。\"\n  